{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55645","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十三 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身心闲後思怡然，缅想难忘契道言。\n千种却教归淡薄，万般须是到根源。\n疎疎雨趁归巢鸟，密密烟藏抱子猿。\n禅罢吟来无一事，远山驱景入茅轩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}